{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is circulating in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the distant wind blew from the other side of the ocean, the mysterious East brought gorgeous satin, porcelain, and - miracles. A small number of people worshipped it as a god, but more people were afraid of it. People held up sickles and torches, avoiding it as if they saw a medieval wizard, and spurned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many years later, people forgot about it, and the miracle eventually became a distant rumor and disappeared in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the fictional Europe at the end of the 19th century. The player will play the role of a teenager working in a pet store. One day, he accidentally stepped into a mysterious toy store and discovered a strange and unusual thing. From then on, his fate began to turn - miracle? Rumor? Resurrection from the dead? The player gradually explores the truth in his contact with the three shop assistants. Maybe... things are not as simple as you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the foggy city, in the silent night, there is a light guiding the lost pedestrians. Love and sadness are intertwined, gradually revealing the truth about a fire five years ago. The resurrected dead, the incomplete memories, the familiar appearance, is it sin or redemption? And are they annihilated or reborn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the invisible power and explore the story in the toy store. The truth... may be even sadder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a European extra chapter of the &quot;Oriental Dreams&quot; series. When the ancient jade from Qiyunzhou flows overseas, the mysterious oriental power will open a new chapter.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u4e00\u8eab\u53cd\u9aa8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3061100/bf6081035b3be383cc3000db9b0614aebbd67a97.jpg"},{"name":"\u851a\u84dd\u5c0